Description: panvk: fix mirrored-repeat offsets for Bifrost explicit LOD
 Apply the offset before wrapping for explicit-LOD operations that use
 a single mip level. Scale it using the sampled mip dimensions.
 On the Mali-G76 this fixes 195 of the 500 failures in the GLSL
 Mirror/Repeat offset sample without introducing new failures.
Forwarded: no
License: MIT (as the patched file)
Last-Update: 2026-11-24
